 "rules": [
  "unknown fields fail validation with <section>_unknown_field",
  "amounts are integers in the smallest unit of the declared asset; no floats anywhere in the canonical form",
  "milestone operation (contract id, kind, input commitment) is bound at freeze; the frozen digest never changes",
  "compare() classifies differences as consequential (price, recipient, thresholds, predicates, deadlines, schemes) or cosmetic (title, purpose, notes)",
  "an accepted negative determination (INFEASIBLE with verification_passed and artifact_complete) earns the complete amount under outcome_neutral payment rules",
  "fee_policy.treasury_bps splits a settled payment with floor rounding; the remainder goes to the provider"
 ]
